  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Enchantment Spell. While you maintain this enchantment, target ally cannot lose more than 5% max Health due to damage from a single attack or spell. When Protective Bond prevents damage, you lose 6...4...3 Energy or the spell ends.",
      "zhTW": "當你維持此「加持」時，使目標盟友受到的單一攻擊或是「魔法」傷害，不會超過體力最大值的 5% 。當保護連結成功抵擋傷害時，你將損失 6～3 能量或保護連結效果終止。"
    },
